WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
On mobile, a customer selects an available time.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
On desktop, the booking calendar opens available times for the selected day.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.320
The booking appears in the business calendar.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.280
The owner changes Sunday’s closing time to noon.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.320
The public slot list reflects the shorter hours.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.000
Tori confirms a demo appointment on screen.
